# Parsers

## Packages

- `packages/css-parser`: base CSS parsing
- `packages/less-parser`: LESS parsing
- `packages/scss-parser`: SCSS parsing (includes sass-spec cache scripts)
- `packages/parser`: Jess CST parser/orchestrator

## Typical hotspots

- `src/*Tokens*`, `src/*Parser*`, `src/productions.ts`
- Tests under `test/**/*.test.ts` (package-dependent)

## Debugging guardrails

- Treat Chevrotain parser objects as potentially circular; avoid `JSON.stringify` on parser/AST objects.

